{
 "total": 39.313,
 "frases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "a": 0.15,
   "b": 2.426,
   "texto": "Landscape fabric is a total scam!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "a": 2.576,
   "b": 4.903,
   "texto": "Hit like and follow. This one starts a war!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "a": 5.023,
   "b": 10.064,
   "texto": "You lay it down, cover it with mulch, and three years later? Weeds! On top of it!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "a": 10.184,
   "b": 15.179,
   "texto": "Okay, she's not wrong. Mulch breaks down into soil, right on the fabric, and seeds love it.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "a": 15.299,
   "b": 18.44,
   "texto": "And the roots grow right through it. Good luck pulling that out!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "a": 18.56,
   "b": 20.796,
   "texto": "So it's useless. Rip it all out!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "a": 20.916,
   "b": 22.009,
   "texto": "Not so fast!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "a": 22.109,
   "b": 24.181,
   "texto": "Under a gravel path, it's a hero.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "a": 24.261,
   "b": 26.733,
   "texto": "It keeps the stones from sinking into the mud below.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "a": 26.883,
   "b": 28.311,
   "texto": "Wait. So it depends?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "a": 28.411,
   "b": 32.331,
   "texto": "In flower beds, skip it, and use thick mulch. Under gravel, keep it.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "a": 32.481,
   "b": 33.962,
   "texto": "Ugh. I hate it when you're right.",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "a": 34.162,
   "b": 36.954,
   "texto": "Team Fabric or Team No Fabric? Fight in the comments!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "a": 37.154,
   "b": 39.313,
   "texto": "Follow for more backyard builds that won't fail!",
   "h": 0
  }
 ],
